<title>USA: GTE Corp begins tender for BBN Corp.</title>
<headline>GTE Corp begins tender for BBN Corp.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Corp said Monday that its GTE Massachusettes Inc subsidiary has begun the cash tender offer for BBN Corp at $29 a share.</p>
<p>GTE, which announced its intention to buy the Internet service provider last week, said the offer and withdrawal right are scheduled to expire at midnight June 9.</p>
</text>
